flowchart LR
  Dev[Developer] -->|Git commit / push| Repo[GitHub repository]
  Repo -->|main branch trigger| Actions[GitHub Actions]
  Actions --> Test[Ruff + Bandit + pip-audit + pytest]
  Test --> TerraformCheck[Terraform fmt and validate]
  TerraformCheck --> Build[Docker build]
  Build --> Scan[Trivy image scan]
  Scan -->|Pass| Registry[Google Artifact Registry<br/>commit-SHA tag]
  Registry -->|deploy| Run[Google Cloud Run<br/>HTTPS / revisions / autoscaling]
  Actions -. OIDC token .-> WIF[Google Cloud Workload Identity Federation]
  WIF -. short-lived identity .-> IAM[Scoped deployer service account]
  Terraform[Terraform] --> Registry
  Terraform --> IAM
  Terraform --> Run
  Run --> Postman[Postman + smoke tests]
  Run --> Users[Public API consumers]
